&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are sourcing independent 3D Modeling and Python Specialists to provide their expertise for a specialized AI 3D asset collection project. As AI models increasingly generate and interact with 3D environments, their accuracy relies entirely on robust, expert-crafted training data. The objective of this project is to autonomously produce collision-accurate 3D meshes from 2D reference images, write procedural generation scripts, and deliver structured programmatic outputs (JSON/JS) to train AI systems on geometric construction and trajectory logic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Deliverables &amp;amp; Scope&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operate autonomously to generate precise 3D assets and programmed outputs. Expected deliverables include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Procedural Geometry Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Writing Blender Python (bpy) scripts or Three.js/JavaScript code to procedurally generate 3D geometry using geometric primitives and Boolean operations (union, subtraction, extrusion).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mesh Alignment &amp;amp; Export:&lt;/strong&gt; Producing collision-accurate meshes from 2D reference images (masked + RGB), capturing accurate screenshot alignments, and exporting assets to .obj, .glb, or similar formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Output &amp;amp; Trajectory Logging:&lt;/strong&gt; Producing programmatic JSON/JS outputs representing the mesh and maintaining meticulous trajectory logs that capture sequential build actions for reproducibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Assurance &amp;amp; Workflow Adherence:&lt;/strong&gt; Auditing all assets against strict quality checklists before submission, maintaining precise file naming conventions, and sustaining high-volume output within a structured annotation platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To successfully fulfill the deliverables of this project, Contractors must possess a strong blend of 3D modeling fundamentals and programmatic scripting skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core skillset includes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable proficiency in Blender Python scripting (bpy) and/or Three.js/JavaScript. &lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be able to write code to generate outputs; GUI-only modeling experience will not qualify for this project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of geometric primitives (cubes, spheres, cylinders, cones) and Boolean operations, with a focus on low-poly construction rather than high-fidelity, subdivision-heavy sculpting (e.g., ZBrush).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience creating collision-accurate 3D meshes from 2D reference images.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly detail-oriented with the discipline to maintain trajectory logs, strictly follow file naming conventions, and self-audit work to maintain high reliability scores.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Background in game asset creation, familiarity with screen recording/keylogging tools, or prior experience within AI/ML data annotation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a fixed pay rate of $22 per hour. As a contractor you’ll supply a secure computer and high‑speed internet; company‑sponsored benefits such as health insurance and PTO do not apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Freelance / Independent Contractor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Are you an accounting expert eager to shape the future of AI? Large‑scale language models are evolving from clever chatbots into powerful engines of financial insight. With high‑quality training data, tomorrow’s AI can democratize world‑class education, keep pace with industry regulations, and streamline workflows for professionals everywhere. That training data begins with you—we need your expertise to help power the next generation of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for accounting specialists who live and breathe financial reporting, auditing, tax compliance, cost accounting, management accounting, and financial analysis. You’ll challenge advanced language models on topics like GAAP and IFRS standards, ledger reconciliation, internal controls, cash flow forecasting, tax code interpretation, and budgeting strategies—documenting every failure mode so we can harden model reasoning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On a typical day, you will converse with the model on real-world accounting scenarios and theoretical financial questions, verify factual accuracy and logical soundness, capture reproducible error traces, and suggest improvements to our prompt engineering and evaluation metrics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A bachelor’s or master’s in accounting, finance, or a closely related field is ideal; CPA licensure, experience with financial audits, tax preparation, or ERP systems like SAP or Oracle signal fit. Clear, metacognitive communication—“showing your work”—is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to turn your accounting expertise into the knowledge base for tomorrow’s AI? Apply today and start teaching the model that will teach the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a pay range of $6-to- $65 per hour, with the exact rate determined after evaluating your experience, expertise, and geographic location. Final offer amounts may vary from the pay range listed above. As a contractor you’ll supply a secure computer and high‑speed internet; company‑sponsored benefits such as health insurance and PTO do not apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employment type: Contract&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workplace type: Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Seniority level: Mid‑Senior Level&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Are you a coding expert fluent in French eager to shape the future of AI? Large‑scale language models are evolving from clever chatbots into powerful engines of scientific discovery. With high‑quality training data, tomorrow’s AI can democratize world‑class education, keep pace with cutting‑edge research, and streamline software development for engineers everywhere. That training data begins with you—we need your expertise to help power the next generation of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for coding specialists who live and breathe algorithms, data structures, software architecture, frontend and backend development, cloud infrastructure, and systems programming—and who can do so fluently in French. You’ll challenge advanced language models on topics like asynchronous programming, RESTful API integration, memory management, object-oriented design, secure coding practices, and debugging distributed systems—documenting every failure mode so we can harden model reasoning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On a typical day, you will converse with the model on software engineering tasks and technical scenarios in French, verify logical accuracy and coding fluency, assess naturalness and correctness of French language usage, capture reproducible error traces, and suggest improvements to our prompt engineering and evaluation metrics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A bachelor’s, master’s, or PhD in computer science, software engineering, or a closely related technical field is ideal; real-world coding experience, technical writing in French, or open-source contributions signal fit. Clear, metacognitive communication—“showing your work”—is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to turn your coding and French language expertise into the knowledge base for tomorrow’s AI? Apply today and start teaching the model that will teach the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a pay range of $8‑to‑$65 per hour, with the exact rate determined after evaluating your experience, expertise, and geographic location. Final offer amounts may vary from the pay range listed above. As a contractor you’ll supply a secure computer and high‑speed internet; company‑sponsored benefits such as health insurance and PTO do not apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job title: Coding Specialist - (Fluent in French) - AI Trainer&lt;br&gt;Employment type: Contract&lt;br&gt;Workplace type: Remote&lt;br&gt;Seniority level: Mid‑Senior Level&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Are you an Afrikaans language expert eager to shape the future of AI? Large-scale language models are evolving from clever chatbots into powerful engines of linguistic discovery. With high-quality training data, tomorrow’s AI can democratize world-class education, keep pace with cutting-edge research, and streamline communication for Afrikaans speakers everywhere. That training data begins with you—we need your expertise to help power the next generation of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for Afrikaans language specialists who live and breathe Afrikaans grammar, syntax, morphology, spelling, phonology, and pragmatics. You’ll challenge advanced language models on topics like verb tense and aspect, sentence structure, word order, regional varieties, formal and informal registers, and the nuances of the Afrikaans writing system—documenting every failure mode so we can harden model reasoning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On a typical day, you will converse with the model on language scenarios, verify factual accuracy and logical soundness, capture reproducible error traces, and suggest improvements to our prompt engineering and evaluation metrics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A master’s or PhD in Afrikaans language, linguistics, or a closely related field is ideal; peer-reviewed publications, teaching experience, or hands-on linguistic analysis projects signal fit. Clear, metacognitive communication—“showing your work”—is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to turn your Afrikaans language expertise into the knowledge base for tomorrow’s AI? Apply today and start teaching the model that will teach the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a pay range of $8 to $65 per hour, with the exact rate determined after evaluating your experience, expertise, and geographic location. Final offer amounts may vary from the pay range listed above. As a contractor, you’ll supply a secure computer and high-speed internet; company-sponsored benefits such as health insurance and PTO do not apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job title: Afrikaans Language Specialist – AI Trainer&lt;br&gt;Employment type: Contract&lt;br&gt;Workplace type: Remote&lt;br&gt;Seniority level: Mid-Senior Level&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Business-to-Business (B2B) / Independent Contractor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity: Define the &quot;Ground Truth&quot; for Generative AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to engage elite Subject Matter Experts (SMEs) to partner with us on high-impact AI evaluation and training projects. We are not looking for generalists; we are seeking established authorities—the top 1% in their respective fields—who are eager to apply their deep domain knowledge to shape the reasoning, accuracy, and safety of next-generation Large Language Models (LLMs).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a consulting engagement for independent professionals who want to help define what &quot;perfection&quot; looks like in their industry. You will not just be grading AI; you will be architecting the &lt;strong&gt;&quot;Gold Standard&quot;&lt;/strong&gt; rubrics that teach models how to think like an expert.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope of Services &amp;amp; Deliverables&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This engagement focuses on high-level advisory and specialized analysis. Consultants will operate under a Statement of Work (SOW) to provide the following deliverables:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rubric Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Review and advise on the quality criteria used to evaluate AI outputs. You will determine if the AI’s logic holds up to professional scrutiny in your field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;Golden&quot; Data Curation:&lt;/strong&gt; Create, edit, or certify &quot;Golden Tasks&quot;—benchmark examples of perfect prompts and responses that serve as the ground truth for model training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expert Gap Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze model failures (hallucinations, logical fallacies) and provide technical breakdowns of &lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; the model failed and how a human expert would have approached the problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advisory on Complexity:&lt;/strong&gt; Consult on the difficulty and nuance of specific prompts to ensure the AI is being tested against sufficiently rigorous scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultant Profile: Who We Are Looking To Partner With&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking independent business owners, freelancers, and academic leaders who possess:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elite Domain Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced degrees (PhD, MD, JD) or equivalent industry-recognized status (e.g., Senior Principal Engineer, Published Author, Award-Winning Creative).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; You currently operate as an independent consultant or freelancer and have your own workflows, equipment, and professional methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interest in Shaping Technology:&lt;/strong&gt; While prior experience in AI evaluation is a bonus, it is absolutely not required. We want industry veterans who are eager to set the &quot;gold standard&quot; for how AI should operate within their specific profession.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Articulate Reasoning:&lt;/strong&gt; The ability to not just know the right answer, but to articulate the &lt;em&gt;reasoning process&lt;/em&gt; clearly in writing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement Structure &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a strictly non-employee, independent contractor opportunity designed for professionals who manage their own business operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engagements are &lt;strong&gt;project-based and non-exclusive&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing you to continue working with other clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have flexibility in &lt;strong&gt;how you complete deliverables&lt;/strong&gt;, in alignment with project requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope, timelines, and compensation are &lt;strong&gt;defined in advance&lt;/strong&gt; for each assignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote &amp;amp; Independent:&lt;/strong&gt; You provide your own workspace and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Candidates must be properly registered to operate as independent contractors in their country of residence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Top-Tier Consultants Partner With Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intellectual Challenge:&lt;/strong&gt; This is rare, cerebral work that challenges you to deconstruct your own expertise to train a machine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Value Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Your input directly influences the safety and capability of models used by millions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Revenue Stream:&lt;/strong&gt; Supplement your primary consulting business with flexible, high-value project work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
